@@ -0,0 +1,111 @@
+/* Copyright (c) 2015-2022, EPFL/Blue Brain Project
+ * All rights reserved. Do not distribute without permission.
+ * Responsible author: Nadir Roman Guerrero <nadir.romanguerrero@epfl.ch>
